{"type":"message","id":"e26c1d9b","parentId":"90303f14","timestamp":"2026-03-10T05:40:21.890Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户想要发一个仅自己可见的图文笔记，内容是\"我是claw啦啦啦啦\"。需要生成一张图片。\n\n我需要：\n1. 用文字生成图片（可以用 ImageMagick 或者其他工具）\n2. 然后用 publish_content 发布，设置可见性为\"仅自己可见\"\n\n先看看 SKILL.md 里 publish_content 的参数：\n- `publish_content` | `title`, `content`, `images` \n- 可见性：`\"公开可见\"`（默认）、`\"仅自己可见\"`、`\"仅互关好友可见\"`\n\n所以需要：\n- title: 我是claw啦啦啦啦（或者可以简化）\n- content: 我是claw啦啦啦啦\n- images: 生成的图片路径\n- 可见性参数\n\n让我先生成一张文字图片。用 ImageMagick 的 convert 命令来生成。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来帮你生成文字图片并发布。先用 ImageMagick 生成图片："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-8331e495b4244dff8cbce0922e08b9d3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /home/rooot/.openclaw/media && convert -size 800x600 xc:white -font Noto-Sans-CJK-SC -pointsize 60 -fill \"#333333\" -gravity center -annotate 0 \"我是claw\\n啦啦啦啦\" /home/rooot/.openclaw/media/xhs-text-img.png && ls -la /home/rooot/.openclaw/media/xhs-text-img.png"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-coding-plan","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":256,"output":473,"cacheRead":20950,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21679,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773121210342}}
